      <trans-unit id="Questionnaire-mii-qst-pro-whodas-whodas12" resname="Questionnaire.copyright">
             <notes>
               <note id="n1">Questionnaire.copyright</note>
             </notes>
        <source>WHODAS 2.0 © World Health Organization 2010 (Measuring Health and Disability: Manual for WHODAS 2.0, ISBN 9789241547598). WHO permits clinicians to reproduce WHODAS 2.0 for use with their own patients free of charge. Any other use — including reproduction in an electronic data capture system — requires a licence agreement (free of charge for non-commercial use) via the WHO Classifications licensing process; translations require WHO permission. The German item wording follows the validated PCOR-MII Item Level Dictionary. Only the MII-authored FHIR content (profiles, codes, scoring) is licensed CC0; the WHODAS 2.0 item text remains © World Health Organization.</source>
        <target></target>
      </trans-unit>
